msgctxt "64"
msgid "(This shisa looks a lot like the one in that couple's photo.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "76"
msgid "(Better give those two a call.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "136"
msgid "Hello?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "148"
msgid "Hey. I'm the one you gave the shisa photo to."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "160"
msgid "Huh? You mean you've actually been looking for it!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "172"
msgid "Yeah, and I found one that looks just like it. Can you come check it out?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "184"
msgid "Yes, absolutely! We'll be right there!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "292"
msgid "So, you say you've found the shisa in the photo?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "304"
msgid "Yeah. Over there."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "316"
msgid ""
"Oh my goodness! That's it! It's the spitting image of the\r\n"
"one we have at home!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "328"
msgid "To find it here, of all places..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "340"
msgid ""
"Don't you feel a little sorry for it? It's been searching\r\n"
"for its partner this whole time..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "364"
msgid "Well, why don't we ask these people if they'll let us buy it!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "388"
msgid ""
"Thank you so much. It's not a whole lot, but please, take\r\n"
"this."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "400"
msgid "You got <Color:8>50,000 yen<Color:Default>."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "424"
msgid ""
"Now our house is properly protected. I hope we can stay\r\n"
"as close as these two crazy creatures!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "436"
msgid ""
"...Close enough to welcome a new little creature into our lives? Maybe next "
"year?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "448"
msgid ""
"You don't mean... a baby? Then... I guess all three of us will have to come "
"back to Okinawa for a family trip!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "472"
msgid "You got 3,000 EXP."
msgstr ""

